guide forever/collectibles/mounts/alliance/paladin-charger
title Paladin Charger
category Class
folder Paladin
keywords Summon Charger, Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker, Emphasis on Sacrifice, High Priest Rohan, Exorcism Censer, Exorcising Terrordale, Grimand Elmore, Collection of Goods, Arcanite Barding, Arcanite Bar, Runecloth, Arthas' Tears, Stratholme Holy Water, Ancient Equine Spirit, Manna-Enriched Horse Feed, Enriched Manna Biscuit, Merideth Carlson, Tendris Warpwood, Divination Scryer, Azerothian Diamond, Pristine Black Diamond, Judgment and Redemption, Death Knight Darkreaver, Great Ossuary, Stratholme, Dire Maul, Scholomance, Paladin, class mount
