# Summon Charger for Alliance Paladins: the whole chain, from the trainer's
# hand-off to Darkreaver's Fallen Charger in Scholomance.
# Sources: Forever client 1.60.1.70450 tables (Mount: the spell
# is still a Forever mount; ItemSparse for the Enriched Manna Biscuit: five
# for 60 silver, Argent Dawn Friendly); quests.json, the knowledge base and
# the Forever server tables (TDB) for the chain, the givers, the objectives,
# the money each turn-in takes (150 gold for Rohan, 150 for Grimand, 50 for
# Merideth) and the items each quest hands you (Rohan's censer, the Exorcism
# Censer, the Arcanite Barding, Lord Grayson's Satchel with the Divination
# Scryer and the Blessed Arcanite Barding).
# The chain: Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker (7638 from Duthorian Rall in
# Stormwind, or 7670 from Brandur Ironhammer in Ironforge; they exclude each
# other) -> Emphasis on Sacrifice (7637: High Priest Rohan in Ironforge, 150
# gold) -> To Show Due Judgment (7639) -> Exorcising Terrordale (7640: 25
# Terrordale Spirits with the Exorcism Censer) -> The Work of Grimand Elmore
# (7641) -> Collection of Goods (7642: 40 Runecloth, 6 Arcanite Bars, 10
# Arthas' Tears, 5 Stratholme Holy Water and 150 gold) -> Grimand's Finest
# Work (7648: the Arcanite Barding to Lord Grayson) -> Ancient Equine Spirit
# (7643, with Manna-Enriched Horse Feed 7645: 20 Enriched Manna Biscuits and
# 50 gold for Merideth Carlson in Southshore; Tendris Warpwood in Dire Maul
# frees the spirit) -> Blessed Arcanite Barding (7644) -> The Divination
# Scryer (7646: an Azerothian Diamond and a Pristine Black Diamond) ->
# Judgment and Redemption (7647: the Divination Scryer in the Great Ossuary of
# Scholomance, Death Knight Darkreaver, the Charger's Redeemed Soul) ->
# Summon Charger.
# quests.json gives The Work of Grimand Elmore (7641) and Ancient Equine
# Spirit (7643) no `pre`; the codex has them after Exorcising Terrordale
# (7640) and Collection of Goods (7642), and the story (Lord Grayson sends
# you on after each) and Forever's quest chain data put them after 7640 and
# Grimand's Finest Work (7648). This guide follows that order.
# Again Into the Great Ossuary (7666) is only named in a tip: it is a
# repeatable quest after the mount, to fight Darkreaver again; a failed
# attempt is redone by abandoning Judgment and Redemption and taking it again.
# Players' notes in Forever's quest data for the tricks: the censer only works
# inside a green Terrordale Haunting Spirit (three spirits a use, Wailing
# Dead lowers your stats by 30%), Supply Crates in both halves of Stratholme,
# Tendris calling the courtyard's Ironbark Protectors, the Crescent Key for
# Dire Maul West, the four spirit waves judged with Wisdom, Justice,
# Righteousness and Light, the locked gates after a wipe, Darkreaver's
# Dominate Mind, the soul redeemed only inside the Ossuary.
# Places: npcs.json for the givers, the quartermasters and the Terrordale
# auras; data/codex/entrances.json (QuestieDB Forever) for Scholomance (Caer
# Darrow, Western Plaguelands 69.7,73.2) and Stratholme's main gate (Eastern
# Plaguelands 26.5,10.4, Forever's map). Our data has only the Dire Maul gate
# at the foot of the ruins (Feralas 59.2,45.1); the West wing's door is at
# 60.3,30.2 (one reference guide's door step and a Forever dungeon guide's 60.3,31.8
# agree; the same point as forever/collectibles/mounts/neutral/warlock-dreadsteed).
# Tendris Warpwood, the Ancient Equine Spirit, Darkreaver and his Fallen
# Charger have no spawns in our data (they are inside the dungeons): their
# goals point at the entrances.
# Dungeon work: Stratholme, Dire Maul West and Scholomance, groups of five
# at 60.
# ASSUMED: The dungeon parts (Stratholme's crates, Tendris Warpwood and the Ancient Equine Spirit in Dire Maul West, the Great Ossuary event in Scholomance) work as in Classic (Classic flow; Forever's data has no spawns inside these dungeons). In-game check: the first runs at 60.
# Riding: Summon Charger needs no Journeyman Riding. Forever client 1.60.1.70532
# (wago.tools): its mount type's MountCapability asks for Riding 0 and gives 100%
# speed; PlayerCondition 27943 asks only for the Paladin quest "Judgment and
# Redemption" (7647).
# Horde paladins: the Forever client has a Summon Forsaken Charger (spell
# 1296534); news reports name its quest "Justice and Retribution", but
# Forever's quest data has no quest for it yet (searched 2026-10-29), so this
# guide stays Alliance.
# Based on data, not play: the beta capped at level 30 until launch on
# 4 November.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker

step Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker (Ironforge)
  only Dwarf
  zone Ironforge
  tip At 60 Brandur Ironhammer in the Mystic Ward sends you to Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in Stormwind's Cathedral of Light.
  level 60
  accept 7670                         -- Brandur Ironhammer

step Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker
  zone Stormwind City
  tip The Summon Charger chain is long: Stratholme, Dire Maul West and Scholomance with a group, 350 gold in donations, and materials worth several hundred more (6 Arcanite Bars, 40 Runecloth, 10 Arthas' Tears, two diamonds). Start saving early. Lord Grayson stands in the Cathedral of Light, Duthorian Rall nearby.
  level 60
  accept 7638 only Human              -- Duthorian Rall, Cathedral of Light
  turnin 7638 only Human
  turnin 7670 only Dwarf
  accept 7637

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Exorcism Censer

step High Priest Rohan
  zone Ironforge
  tip High Priest Rohan, the priest trainer, walks about the Hall of Mysteries in Ironforge's Mystic Ward. He gives you his censer for a donation of 150 gold, taken at the hand-in. Keep the censer.
  money 150g
  turnin 7637                         -- High Priest Rohan: 150 gold
  accept 7639

step Back to Lord Grayson
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Lord Grayson blesses the censer into the Exorcism Censer for Terrordale.
  turnin 7639                         -- Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker
  accept 7640

step Exorcising Terrordale
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Terrordale lies in the far north-west of the Eastern Plaguelands, west of the Stratholme gates. Stand inside a green glowing patch on the ground (a Terrordale Haunting Spirit; some are inside the ruined houses) and use the Exorcism Censer: up to three Terrordale Spirits (level 59-60) rise and attack. Their Wailing Dead lowers all your stats by 30%: fight them one at a time and use Turn Undead. The patches come back quickly; several paladins can work side by side.
  use 18752 @14.5,25.5                -- Exorcism Censer, inside a green patch
  kill 14564 quest 7640.1             -- Terrordale Spirits x25

step Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Lord Grayson takes the censer back.
  turnin 7640                         -- Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker
  accept 7641

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Arcanite Barding

step Grimand Elmore
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Grimand Elmore works in Stormwind's Dwarven District. He forges the Arcanite Barding from your materials and 150 gold.
  turnin 7641                         -- Grimand Elmore
  accept 7642

step Grimand's materials
  tip Runecloth drops from humanoids of level 50 and up (Everlook's Bruisers, the Scarlet Crusade in the Plaguelands, the Dire Maul ogres). Arthas' Tears is a Plaguelands herb (Herbalism 220), common around Chillwind Camp. An Arcanite Bar is an alchemist's transmute from a Thorium Bar and an Arcane Crystal, once every two days per alchemist: ask a guild alchemist early, or buy the bars. The Auction House sells all three.
  collect 14047 quest 7642.3 @61.2,71.3 live -- Runecloth x40
  collect 8836 quest 7642.2           -- Arthas' Tears x10
  collect 12360 quest 7642.4 @61.2,71.3 live -- Arcanite Bars x6: an alchemist, or the Trade District Auction House

step Stratholme Holy Water
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Stratholme is a dungeon for a group of five at 58-60, at the north end of the Eastern Plaguelands. Stratholme Supply Crates along the streets of both halves hold the Holy Water, one to three each; they come back after three minutes. Some crates let out a swarm of plagued rats or maggots: be ready. The main gate (the Scarlet half) needs no key.
  goto 26.5,10.4 live "Stratholme"
  collect 13180 quest 7642.1 @26.5,10.4 live -- Stratholme Supply Crates, inside

step Grimand Elmore
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Bring the materials and 150 gold, taken at the hand-in. Grimand walks to his forge and hands you the Arcanite Barding.
  money 150g
  turnin 7642                         -- Grimand Elmore: 150 gold
  accept 7648

step Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Lord Grayson keeps the barding for now: you get it back with the next quest.
  turnin 7648                         -- Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker: the Arcanite Barding
  accept 7643

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Ancient Equine Spirit

step Enriched Manna Biscuits
  zone Western Plaguelands
  tip The Argent Dawn quartermasters sell Enriched Manna Biscuits, five for 60 silver, once the Argent Dawn is Friendly with you: Argent Quartermaster Lightspark at Chillwind Camp or Quartermaster Miranda Breechlock at Light's Hope Chapel. Scourgestones and the Plaguelands quests raise the standing.
  buy 13724 x20 npc 10857             -- Enriched Manna Biscuits: Argent Quartermaster Lightspark, Chillwind Camp

step Merideth Carlson
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip Merideth Carlson breeds horses in Southshore's stable. She makes the Manna-Enriched Horse Feed from the 20 biscuits and 50 gold, taken at the hand-in.
  money 50g
  accept 7645                         -- Merideth Carlson
  buy 13724 x20 npc 10857             -- Enriched Manna Biscuits: Argent Quartermaster Lightspark, Chillwind Camp
  turnin 7645 reward 18775            -- Manna-Enriched Horse Feed

step Dire Maul: Tendris Warpwood
  zone Feralas
  tip Dire Maul lies in central Feralas. From the gate at the foot of the ruins, walk up through the outer courtyards to the West wing's door at their north end; it needs a Crescent Key (from Pusillin in Dire Maul East) or a rogue's lockpicking. Tendris Warpwood (level 60 elite) stands at the far end of the West wing's first courtyard. Once attacked he calls every Ironbark Protector still alive in the courtyard: kill them first. His death frees the Ancient Equine Spirit: talk to it to give it the horse feed and the Arcanite Barding, and it blesses the barding. A group of five at 60.
  goto 60.3,30.2 "Dire Maul West's door"
  kill 11489 @60.3,30.2               -- Tendris Warpwood, inside the West wing
  turnin 7643 @60.3,30.2              -- Ancient Equine Spirit
  accept 7644 @60.3,30.2

step Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker
  zone Stormwind City
  turnin 7644                         -- Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker
  accept 7646

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Darkreaver

step Two diamonds
  tip An Azerothian Diamond comes from Thorium veins and obsidian, about one vein in a hundred; a Pristine Black Diamond drops rarely from elites of level 59 and up (Revanchion and Lord Blackwood about one kill in nine and one in a hundred). The Auction House is the usual source of both.
  collect 12800 quest 7646.1          -- Azerothian Diamond
  collect 18335 quest 7646.2          -- Pristine Black Diamond

step Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Lord Grayson hands you Lord Grayson's Satchel: open it for the Divination Scryer and the Blessed Arcanite Barding. Keep both.
  turnin 7646                         -- Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker
  accept 7647
  use 18804 @48.43,50.22 live         -- Lord Grayson's Satchel
  collect 18792 quest 7647.2 @48.43,50.22 live -- Blessed Arcanite Barding, from the satchel

step The Great Ossuary
  zone Western Plaguelands
  tip Scholomance lies under Caer Darrow, the island town in the south-east of the Western Plaguelands; the door needs the Skeleton Key (The Key to Scholomance). Clear the Great Ossuary, Rattlegore's room in the basement, then use the Divination Scryer at its centre. Four waves of spirits come, each ending with an Aspect: players judge them with Seal of Wisdom, Justice, Righteousness and then Light, which stuns them. Death Knight Darkreaver (level 62 elite) comes after the last; he mind-controls players. Loot the Charger's Lost Soul, use it inside the Ossuary to redeem it, and give it and the Blessed Arcanite Barding to Darkreaver's Fallen Charger. If the group wipes, the gates lock and the scryer is gone: abandon the quest and take it again from Lord Grayson for a new satchel. A group of five at 60. Again Into the Great Ossuary, after the mount, lets you fight him again.
  goto 69.7,73.2 "Scholomance"
  collect 18749 @69.7,73.2            -- Charger's Lost Soul: Death Knight Darkreaver
  use 18749 @69.7,73.2                -- Charger's Lost Soul, inside the Great Ossuary
  collect 18799 quest 7647.1 @69.7,73.2 -- Charger's Redeemed Soul
  turnin 7647 @69.7,73.2              -- Darkreaver's Fallen Charger: Summon Charger
